.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH list 1  "list " 
.SH NAME
list \- List knowledge elements in the current accepted state
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBlist\fR [\fB\-\-type\fR] [\fB\-\-lifecycle\fR] [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fIELEMENT_TYPE\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
List knowledge elements in the current accepted state
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH INSPECTION
.TP
\fB\-\-type\fR \fI<TYPE_FLAG>\fR
Filter by element type (e.g. requirement, design\-decision)
.TP
\fB\-\-lifecycle\fR \fI<LIFECYCLE>\fR
Filter by lifecycle state (active, deprecated, superseded)
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Output structured machine JSON envelope
.TP
[\fIELEMENT_TYPE\fR]
Optional element type positional shorthand (e.g. requirement, design\-decision)
